| MAC 161 | Machine Shop Practices I | 3 |
| MAC 162 | Machine Shop Practices II | 3 |
| MAC 116 | Machinery’s Handbook | 2 |
| SAF 130 | Industrial Safety OSHA-10 | 1 |
| MAC 121 | Numerical Control I | 3 |
| MAC 122 | Numerical Control II | 3 |
| | **Total** | 17 |

**Total Minimum Credits: 17**

